            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": [
              "http://gia.ub.rug.nl/16/\r\nExcavation of a Celtic field complex on the Central Dutch Ice-pushed ridges near Wekerom. Several bank- and field were excavated in small (1 sq m) trenches. The celtic field banks were subjected to palynological, palaeo-geochemical and archaeological analysis coupled with OSL dating."
            ]
